    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051125.0006\n\nMANILA, Nov. 25 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nPhilippine stocks close lower\n\n\n\n\nPhilippine stock prices closed lower Friday with composite index dropping 13.55 points or 0.64 percent to 2,106.10.\n\nTurnover volume was 1.09 billion shares valued at 783.03 million pesos (14.2 million US dollars), while all-shares index fell 6.18 points to 1,274.42.\n\nGainers narrowly beat losers 42 to 38, while 43 stocks were unchanged.\n\nThe Philippine stock market will be closed Monday, a local public holiday.",
